{"task_id": "HumanEval/1", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\n\ndef separate_paren_groups(paren_string: str) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\" Separates multiple groups of nested parentheses into a list of strings.\n    Each group is balanced and not nested within other separated groups.\n    \"\"\"\n    cleaned_string = paren_string.replace(\" \", \"\")\n    result = []\n    balance = 0\n    current_group_start_index = -1\n\n    for i, char in enumerate(cleaned_string):\n        if char == '(':\n            if balance == 0:\n                # Start of a new top-level group\n                current_group_start_index = i\n            balance += 1\n        elif char == ')':\n            balance -= 1\n            if balance == 0:\n                # End of a top-level balanced group\n                if current_group_start_index != -1:\n                    result.append(cleaned_string[current_group_start_index : i + 1])\n                current_group_start_index = -1\n\n    return result\n```"}
